                                                "example_id": "05429bf5-a3ee-45bd-96b3-c8dc3d4c0a12",
                                                "sense_id": "a7ffdc41-4c7f-3e02-b31b-97ace8152a98",
                                                "text": "“Heptathlon is very geared and favorable to those who are quick,” said Gray’s coach, Andy Eggerth, who trains both heptathletes and decathletes. “A lot of world-class heptathletes are relatively bad at javelin and shot-put.”"
