                                                "sense_id": "a7ffdc41-4c7f-3e02-b31b-97ace8152a98",
                                                "text": "He comes from a family of athletes: Greg, his father, was an elite vaulter for the U.S. Helena, his Swedish mother, was an international heptathlete and volleyball player."
